 <gap id=\"gap_2\"><\/gap>, but a video game has real action. Board games are slow.<\/p><p><b>Bea: <\/b>That\u2019s <sup>4<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_3\"><\/gap>, but \u2018slow\u2019 isn\u2019t the same as \u2018bad\u2019. In a video game, you don\u2019t have to imagine anything. It\u2019s like watching a movie.<\/p><p><b>Finn:<\/b> Yes, I <sup>5<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap> with Bea.<\/p><p><b>Kadir:<\/b> I don\u2019t <sup>6<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_5\"><\/gap> so. You need skills to play a video game, but you don\u2019t need skills to watch a movie.<\/p><p><b>Listen again and check your answers.<\/b><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[],"tableConfig":{"mode":"percent","valueArray":[50,50]}}]}